OL,3,GNEWSADozens of job applications but no 
OL,4,Aresponses: What it's like to be Neet   
OL,6,F"Not being able to find a job makes me 
OL,7,Ffeel really useless, and it makes me   
OL,8,Fjust want to stay in bed to be honest."
OL,10,FRhi Smith, 20, from Cam in             
OL,11,FGloucestershire, has applied for dozens
OL,12,Fof retail jobs since leaving college in
OL,13,FMay.                                   
OL,15,FOnly one company has responded to her -
OL,16,Fand they rejected her application.     
OL,18,F"It makes me not want to apply for any 
OL,19,Fmore jobs because I know it's not going
OL,20,Fto go anywhere, so it's sort of like,  
OL,21,Fwhat's the point?"                     
